t><title>1410: A Polish-Lithuanian army crushes the knights at the Battle of Grunwald</title></g><g class="rf-ev"><line x1="597.9" x2="597.9" y1="160" y2="166"/><circle cx="597.9" cy="160" r="8"/><text x="597.9" y="164" text-anchor="middle">6</text><title>1466: The Second Peace of Thorn cedes Royal Prussia to Poland</title></g><g class="rf-ev"><line x1="740.0" x2="740.0" y1="160" y2="166"/><circle cx="740.0" cy="160" r="8"/><text x="740.0" y="164" text-anchor="middle">7</text><title>1525: Albert of Brandenburg-Ansbach secularises the state as the Duchy of Prussia</title></g><text class="rf-axis" x="20" y="200">1226 CE</text><text class="rf-axis" x="740" y="200" text-anchor="end">1525 CE</text></svg><figcaption>Relative power on the Institute's 0–10 scale (each profile scaled to its own peak). Numbers mark the key events below.</figcaption></figure><ol class="rf-events"><li><span class="rf-year">1226</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/golden-bull-of-rimini">Golden Bull of Rimini</a> grants Prussian conquests to Grand Master <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hermann-von-salza">Hermann von Salza</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1237</span><span class="rf-text">The Order absorbs the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/livonian-brothers-of-the-sword">Livonian Brothers of the Sword</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1260</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/great-prussian-uprising">Great Prussian Uprising</a> begins, lasting until 1274</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1309</span><span class="rf-text">The Grand Master moves his seat from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/venice">Venice</a> to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/malbork-castle">Marienburg</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1410</span><span class="rf-text">A Polish-Lithuanian army crushes the knights at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-grunwald">Battle of Grunwald</a></span></l